        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Host→PanelBridge bytes forwarded per <ref refid="namespaceSimGateway_1aa8f7b2f81634cf26fff1d4d03b3ec70b" kindref="member">loop()</ref> call. The UART write blocks once its 32-byte hardware FIFO is full (~40 µs per byte), so an uncapped drain of a DCS export burst would hold <ref refid="namespaceSimGateway_1aa8f7b2f81634cf26fff1d4d03b3ec70b" kindref="member">loop()</ref> for tens of ms. 64 bytes bounds it at ~2.6 ms. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
